  "result": "The clone backend is in place. The full suite passes (74 files, 629 tests), `tsc --noEmit` is clean, and ESLint is clean on the changed files.\n\nChoices the spec left open:\n- **Copy status:** copies start in the workspace's `org.settings.defaultIssueStatus`, re-validated with a fallback to `backlog`, the same way the new-issue form does it.\n- **Atomicity:** all quota checks run before any write. The project row and its copies are written in one SQLite transaction.\n- **Beyond the four listed exports:** I added two repository functions, `listAllLiveIssues` (pages through every live issue) and `insertClonedProject` (the transactional write). If you want them module-private, that's a small change.\n- **Webhooks:** `project.cloned` is not added to the webhook event list, since the spec doesn't mention webhooks.\n\nI also added `tests/services/project-clone.test.ts` and one schema test in `tests/schemas/project.schema.test.ts`. No existing visible test encoded the changed behaviour, so none needed updating.",
